    old "\n\nA game by {a=https://campsite.bio/nomax}Nomax{/a}\n\n{u}Co-Writers:{/u}\n\n{a=https://sofurry.com/u/writingdog}Rob{/a}\n\n{a= https://televassi.tv/}Televassi{/a}\n\n{a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}Additional writing by:{/u}\n\nJäger & Rubric\n\n\n\n{u}Animations by: {/u}\n\n{a=https://twitter.com/Yesntpan}Nopan{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}Additional art by:{/u}\n\nSam Hotel Scene Artwork by: {a=https://bsky.app/profile/bananasneon.bsky.social}BananasNEon{/a}\n\nUI Character Icons by: {a=https://boosty.to/gveanel}Gvaneal{/a}\n\n\n\nA massive thanks to all our Patrons who make the continued development of this game possible in the first place! If you want to support us you can do so here: {a=https://www.patreon.com/Nomax}Patreon{/a} or {a=https://subscribestar.adult/nomax}Subscribestar{/a}\n\nA very special thanks to Envi for going through the font and fixing some kerning issues and missing characters.\n\nSpecial thanks to those who helped along the way with proofreading, playtesting, bouncing ideas off of, and all that good stuff: Birdsongchoir, Dabby, Erkhyan, Feodorath, InvokingAzure, J.N.Squire, Kira, Maru, Samaki, Spoots, Toffee, Utunu, Vorell.\n\n\n\n{u}Special Thanks:{/u}\n\ntofurocks for the {a=https://tofurocks.itch.io/snowfall-gui}Snowfall Plugin{/a} used under {a=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/}Creative Commons 3.0 license{/a} for some of the rainy scenes.\n\nWattson for the {a=https://wattson.itch.io/renpy-auto-highlight}Auto Highlighter{/a}.\n\n\n\n{u}Music:{/u}\n\nMain Menu Theme {a=https://musopen.org/de/music/43610-sicilienne-in-e-flat-major/}Sicilienne from Maria Theresia von Paradis{/a}, performed by Carola Zosi & Stefano Ligoratti. Usage under {a=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/legalcode}Creative Commons 3.0 license{/a}.\n\nJames and Wolf at the Ruins of Despair, by: {a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\nWolf playing the fife, by: {a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}Other Music by:{/u}\n\n{a=https://donat-baracsi.itch.io/}Donato Barasci{/a}\n\n{a=https://linktr.ee/magnalitymusic}Magnality{/a}"
    new "\n\n一款由{a=https://campsite.bio/nomax}Nomax{/a}制作的游戏\n\n{u}联合编剧：{/u}\n\n{a=https://sofurry.com/u/writingdog}Rob{/a}\n\n{a= https://televassi.tv/}Televassi{/a}\n\n{a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}额外编剧：{/u}\n\nJäger & Rubric\n\n\n\n{u}动画制作：{/u}\n\n{a=https://twitter.com/Yesntpan}Nopan{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}额外美术：{/u}\n\nSam Hotel场景美术：{a=https://bsky.app/profile/bananasneon.bsky.social}BananasNEon{/a}\n\nUI角色图标：{a=https://boosty.to/gveanel}Gvaneal{/a}\n\n\n\n衷心感谢所有赞助者，正是你们的支持才使得这款游戏得以持续开发！如果您想支持我们，可以通过以下方式：{a=https://www.patreon.com/Nomax}Patreon{/a}或{a=https://subscribestar.adult/nomax}Subscribestar{/a}\n\n特别感谢Envi仔细检查字体并修复了一些字距问题和缺失字符。\n\n特别感谢那些一路走来帮助我们校对、测试游戏、提出想法以及提供所有帮助的人：Birdsongchoir、Dabby、Erkhyan、Feodorath、InvokingAzure、J.N.Squire、Kira、Maru、Samaki、Spoots、Toffee、Utunu、Vorell。\n\n\n\n{u}特别感谢：{/u}\n\ntofurocks 提供 {a=https://tofurocks.itch.io/snowfall-gui}雪落插件{/a}，部分雨景采用 {a=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/}CC 3.0 协议{/a}。\n\nWattson 提供 {a=https://wattson.itch.io/renpy-auto-highlight}自动高亮工具{/a}。\n\n\n\n{u}音乐：{/u}\n\n主菜单主题曲 {a=https://musopen.org/de/music/43610-sicilienne-in-e-flat-major/}Sicilienne选自Maria Theresia von Paradis{/a}，由 Carola Zosi 和 Stefano Ligoratti 演奏。采用 {a=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/legalcode}CC 3.0 协议{/a}。\n\nJames and Wolf at the Ruins of Despair，作者：{a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\nWolf吹奏横笛，作者：{a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}其他音乐由：{/u}\n\n{a=https://donat-baracsi.itch.io/}Donato Barasci{/a}\n\n{a=https://linktr.ee/magnalitymusic}Magnality{/a}"

